                                                                                
 Usage: opentide setup repo [OPTIONS] [path]                                    
                                                                                
 Scaffold a detection repository.                                               
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --path         -C      <str>     Repository path [default: .]                │
│ --name                 <str>     Repository name, used in the README         │
│ --org                  <str>     Organisation or team, used in the README    │
│ --description          <str>     One-line description, used in the README    │
│ --platform             PLATFORM  Enable a detection platform (repeatable):   │
│                                  sentinel, splunk, crowdstrike,              │
│                                  defender_for_endpoint, sentinel_one,        │
│                                  carbon_black_cloud, harfanglab, elastic,    │
│                                  sysdig                                      │
│ --plan                           List the files each step would write, and   │
│                                  write nothing                               │
│ --yes          -y                Write without asking for confirmation       │
│ --help                           Show this message and exit.                 │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup repo --yes --name "Detections" --platform sentinel
